041C68             0291*   ; https://discord.com/channels/1158535358624039014/1282290921815408681/1329274504022720512
041C68             0292*   ; calc84maniac's 32-bit by 23-bit division routine
041C68             0293*   ; This divides AUIX by UDE (maximum 23 bits)
041C68             0294*   ; The result is stored in AUIX, the remainder in UHL
041C68             0295*   ; UDE, C are unmodified
